==English==

===Etymology===
From {{confix|naturo|pathy}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|naturopathies}}

# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} A system of [[therapy]] that avoids drugs and surgery and emphasizes the use of natural remedies (air, water, heat, sunshine) and physical means (massage, electrical treatment) to treat illness.

